        "text": "=Candidate Summary\nSkills: {{ $json.output.skills }}\nYears of Experience: {{ $json.output.years_of_experience }}\nEducation: {{ $json.output.education }}\nProfile Summary: {{ $json.output.profile_summary }}\nRole Applied For: {{ $('Clean Application').item.json.role }}",
        "hasOutputParser": true,
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "=# Overview\nYou are a candidate scoring assistant. Evaluate how well a candidate matches a specific job role based on their resume summary.\n\n## Rules\n- Score candidates from 1 to 10 (decimals allowed).\n- Base the score strictly on skill match and experience.\n- Do not guess missing information.\n- Keep the reasoning under 2 sentences.\n- Output valid JSON only.\n- Never output null.\n\n## Tools\nJob Requirements: use this tool to look up the official requirements for the candidate's role. Pass the exact role name.\n- Roles available: Front End Developer, Back End Developer, Web Designer, DevOps Engineer, AI Engineer, Cloud Specialist.\n- Use only this information to produce the score and reasoning. Do not use outside knowledge or assumptions.\n\n## Output Format\nReturn a single JSON object with a score (number) and a fit_reason (short explanation of the score)."
        }
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "typeVersion": 3.1,
      "position": [
        672,
        256
      ],
